"O Cruzamento is a train station on the F City line toward Apex."
"F City's stations are glossy and immaculate, with car-sized starburst chandeliers."
"Their high arched white ceilings rise over floor tiles that twinkle with embedded lights."
"Manon, the Rabbit who runs the boater, has an office within walking distance of O Cruzamento."
"Karl of the boater got off the train at O Cruzamento when Alden spotted him."
